        "original_id": "e85336a1-f645-52e8-9206-f4476d02440e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pedro Rodríguez, Jacky Ickx\n- Teams: BRM, Ferrari\n- Events: 1968 Belgian Grand Prix, 24 Hours of Le Mans, Can-Am Championship, Dakar Rally\n- Places: Brussels\n- Topics: Formula One\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1968 Belgian Grand Prix, Pedro Rodríguez finished second for the BRM team.\n- In the 1968 Belgian Grand Prix, Ferrari driver Jacky Ickx finished third.\n- Jacky Ickx was born on 1 January 1945 in Brussels.\n- Jacky Ickx is a Belgian former racing driver.\n- Jacky Ickx won the 24 Hours of Le Mans six times.\n- Jacky Ickx achieved eight wins and 25 podium finishes in Formula One.\n- Jacky Ickx won the Can-Am Championship in 1979.\n- Jacky Ickx is a former winner of the Dakar Rally.",
